WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.770
Look up at the cables strung
between giant pylons.

2
00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:06.950
They carry electricity across
the country at a very high

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.430
voltage, high enough
to kill instantly.

4
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.730
Then, before it reaches your home,

5
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.490
the voltage is brought right
down to two hundred and thirty

6
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.750
volts.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.130
Raising the voltage and then
lowering it again costs money and

8
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.850
needs huge equipment.

9
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.430
So why not send it at two hundred
and thirty volts all the way?

10
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.530
In this mission, you'll
meet step-up and step-down

11
00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:31.550
transformers, and see how
they change the voltage of an

12
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.450
alternating supply.

13
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.970
Your mission: explain why
electricity travels across the

14
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.460
country at such a high voltage.
